d» = in Register v1.4, not on develop; &quot;(… «planned»)&quot; = the v1.4 part of an existing screen. Removed in v1.4 (still in code, not drawn): store and listing pages, cart, checkout, pre-order by listing, tag pages and tag scanning. Detailed screens and routes: Figure 3.1a (part 1 of 2: public and Customer; part 2 of 2: Investor portal), Figure 3.1b (Operator workspace), Figure 3.1c (Admin console) and Figure 3.2 (mobile app).&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="980" width="1240" height="87" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="O5 Component" id="O5_Component"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure O.5 – Component Diagram: system overview, sub-systems, external systems, interfaces and protocols&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1500" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="«external system» &lt;b&gt;[X7]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;Static web resources&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;Google Fonts · landing-page photos&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=component;jettyWidth=10;jettyHeight=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#b45309;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="260" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="«subsystem» &lt;b&gt;[C1]&lt;/b&gt; Web App — React SPA on Vercel" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="170" width="260" height="222" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;[C1.1, C1.2, C1.4–C1.7]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;auth · customer orders · investor portal · operator workspace · admin console · public trace page&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=component;jettyWidth=10;jettyHeight=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="216" width="228" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;[C1.3]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;Farm map&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«planned»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=component;jettyWidth=10;jettyHeight=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="328" width="228" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="«external system» &lt;b&gt;[X6]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;Map tile service&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«planned»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=component;jettyWidth=10;jettyHeight=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#b45309;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="442" width="260" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="«subsystem» &lt;b&gt;[C2]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;Mobile App&lt;/b&gt; — Flutter&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;f